sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer as Xaridor
  participant Modal as OrderCheckoutModal
  participant Hook as useCustomerOrders
  participant Repo as orderRepository
  participant Logic as orderLogic.applyStockDecrement
  participant DB as Cloud Firestore & firestore.rules

  Customer->>Modal: Miqdor, usul (pickup/delivery) tanlab "Tasdiqlash" bosadi
  Modal->>Hook: placeOrder(params)
  Hook->>Repo: placeOrderTransaction(params)
  Repo->>DB: runTransaction(tx) boshlanadi
  DB-->>Repo: tx.get(businessRef) va tx.get(productRef)
  Repo->>Logic: applyStockDecrement(currentStock, qty, status)
  Logic-->>Repo: { nextStock, nextStatus } (yoki xato: zaxira yetarli emas)
  Repo->>Repo: calculateOrderTotal(unitPrice, qty)
  Repo->>DB: tx.set(orders/{orderId}, status='pending', paymentStatus='unpaid')
  Repo->>DB: tx.set(orders/{orderId}/items/{itemId}, unitPrice, qty)
  Repo->>DB: tx.update(products/{id}, stock=nextStock, lastCheckoutOrderId=orderId)
  Note over DB: firestore.rules getAfter() orqali stock == oldStock - qty va narxni tekshiradi
  DB-->>Repo: Tranzaksiya tasdiqlandi
  DB-->>Hook: onSnapshot orqali yangi buyurtma va zaxira uzatiladi
  Hook-->>Customer: "Buyurtmalarim" sahifasida buyurtma ID (Kutilmoqda) ko'rinadi
